    "Cost": 940888,
    "UIName": "Wolf Trap",
    "Id": "chassisdef_wolf_trap_WFT-C",
    "Name": "Wolf Trap",
    "Details": "A field modification of the Wolf Trap, the C model is modified to carry a C3 slave unit onto the battlefield, allowing the Wolf Trap to share targeting telemetry with other friendly units. The 'Mech achieves this by removing one of the medium lasers that it carries.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Upper</color>",
